    "steps": [
      "In a blender or food processor, combine the scotch bonnet peppers, green onion, garlic, ginger, allspice, thyme, cinnamon, and nutmeg with the soy sauce, brown sugar, lime juice, vegetable oil, salt, and black pepper. Blend into a thick, fragrant paste.",
      "Place the chicken thighs in a large bowl or zip-top bag and pour the jerk paste over them, massaging it into every piece.",
      "Cover and marinate in the refrigerator for at least 4 hours, ideally overnight, for the best flavor.",
      "Preheat a grill or grill pan to medium-high heat.",
      "Grill the chicken for 6-8 minutes per side, turning occasionally, until deeply charred in spots and the internal temperature reaches 165\u00b0F (74\u00b0C).",
      "Let rest for 5 minutes before serving."
